rar->cstate.initialized = 0;
```

This is set at the end of `process_head_file`. Then when `do_uncompress_file` is called, it checks:
```c
if(!rar->cstate.initialized) {
    if(!rar->main.solid || !rar->cstate.window_buf) {
        init_unpack(rar);  // Frees and reallocs window_buf
    }
    rar->cstate.initialized = 1;
